# hatoove-site/dist is maintained site source and MUST remain tracked.

# Worker scratch space. `.openclaw/` is the local agent workspace - run logs, temp trees and the
# screenshots the browser checkers write. It is NOT application source, and it WAS tracked: 17 binary
# files, which meant every browser run modified tracked files and any commit that happened to run one
# silently swept new screenshots in. Found when a CI-gates commit carried three changed PNGs it had no
# business touching. The checkers still write there; they just no longer write into the repository.
.openclaw/

# Local project inputs, coordination and recovery are not application source.
/design/
/handoff/

# MEDIA-MOUNT-01: the recordings themselves are TRACKED (A12(1)) at content/exams/telc-deutsch-b1/audio/.
# This entry is for the OPT-IN host mount directory only (`HATOVE_AUDIO_ROOT`), so a locally staged audio root
# can never be committed by accident.
media/
